WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:05.776
Create exam types

00:00:05.826 --> 00:00:09.260
Open Academics, then Exam Types.

00:00:11.638 --> 00:00:13.787
Press Add Exam Type.

00:00:15.891 --> 00:00:21.779
Type the name, and set the weight: how much this exam counts toward the final result.

00:00:27.353 --> 00:00:33.972
Tick Final exam only for exams that decide promotion. We leave it off for a unit test.

00:00:34.437 --> 00:00:38.966
Press Create. The new exam type appears in the list.

00:00:42.096 --> 00:00:46.779
Exam type added
